{
  "ability.jjkshowdown.blink": "Blink",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.blink.desc": "Instant movement by contracting space. Aim at an enemy to appear directly behind them.",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.blue": "Lapse: Blue",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.blue.desc": "Tap to create a point of attraction at the crosshair; hold to charge maximum output. Pulls enemies, projectiles and loose terrain into a crushing singularity. Sneak while casting for Blue Movement: the point yanks you across the battlefield.",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.cleave": "Cleave",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.cleave.desc": "A close-range technique that adjusts to the target's toughness: the sturdier the target, the deeper the cut. Tap for a single-target flurry; hold to cleave everything in front of you.",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.dismantle": "Dismantle",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.dismantle.desc": "A razor slash of cursed energy that cuts through enemies and soft terrain. Tap for a single slash; hold (mastery 3) for a barrage.",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.domain_amplification": "Domain Amplification",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.domain_amplification.desc": "Fill your body with a domain that neutralises techniques on contact: your blows pass through Infinity and domain sure-hits are blunted. Your innate technique is unusable while active.",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.fuga": "Divine Flame: Fuga",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.fuga.desc": "Draw a flaming arrow (hold at least one second) and release it into an inferno. Empowered for ten seconds after Malevolent Shrine: bigger blast, half cost and cooldown.",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.hollow_purple": "Hollow Technique: Purple",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.hollow_purple.200": "PURPLE — 200%",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.hollow_purple.desc": "Hold to converge Blue and Red into imaginary mass, then erase everything in a line: terrain, barriers, enemies. At mastery 9, keep holding through the full incantation for 200% output.",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.hollow_purple.jp": "虚式「茈」",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.hollow_purple.short": "PURPLE",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.infinity": "Infinity",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.infinity.desc": "Limitless: an infinite series between you and the world. Projectiles stop mid-air and blows never land. Drains a little cursed energy while active. Neutralised by Domain Amplification, domain sure-hits and the World-Cutting Slash.",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.malevolent_shrine": "Domain Expansion: Malevolent Shrine",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.malevolent_shrine.desc": "An open domain without a barrier. Everything within its enormous radius is ceaselessly Dismantled and Cleaved; terrain is shredded. Burns out your technique afterwards.",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.red": "Reversal: Red",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.red.desc": "Fire a repulsive orb that detonates into a massive blast, launching everything away and cratering terrain. Hold to charge. Point-blank it detonates instantly.",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.reverse_cursed_technique": "Reverse Cursed Technique",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.reverse_cursed_technique.desc": "Hold to multiply negative energy into positive energy and heal. Also repairs your brain after a domain, recovering from burnout three times faster.",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.unlimited_void": "Domain Expansion: Unlimited Void",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.unlimited_void.desc": "Encloses the area in a barrier of infinite space. Everyone inside is flooded with infinite information and cannot move or act. Your strikes against the paralysed deal +50% damage. Burns out your technique afterwards.",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.world_slash": "World-Cutting Slash",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.world_slash.desc": "Chant the incantation — Scale of the Dragon, Recoil, Twin Meteors — and cut the world itself. A single plane that ignores Infinity, armour and toughness.",
  "ability.jjkshowdown.world_slash.jp": "世界を断つ斬撃",
